<title>FRANCE: France must grow faster for more tax cuts - Arthuis.</title>
<headline>France must grow faster for more tax cuts - Arthuis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>French finance minister Jean Arthuis said on Sunday the ability of the French government to cut taxes by more than planned depended on strength of growth in 1997.</p>
<p>Speaking in a radio interview on Europe 1, Arthuis said, &quot;More growth would have the effect of expanding the tax base and give room for manoeurve to cut (tax) rates,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
